# --- git hygiene (CLAUDE.md §2.2, enforced by spikes/harness/githygiene.py) ---
# The history is training data. 86% of history bytes were files >1MB while
# every result in this workspace is plain text. Commit the thing that MAKES
# the artefact -- source, Cargo.toml AND Cargo.lock, the command, the hash --
# not the artefact. A digest pins which artefact; a manifest pins the feature
# set behind it, and a Cargo feature changes fuel_used (V1_feature_fuel).

# third-party model weights: size, and a §7 licence question
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx

# compiled output — rebuild from source + pinned manifest
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.a
*.apk
*.aar
*.jar
spikes/*/bin/fuelrun.*
**/jniLibs/

# archives
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

